{"seq":3,"slug":"listening-speaking","title":"高二英语 — 听说训练","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/english/exam-preparation/listening-speaking","wordCount":1730,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二英语-听说训练\">高二英语 — 听说训练</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>听力和口语是英语综合运用能力的重要体现。高考英语听力部分占总分的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>（各省有差异），而口语能力虽然部分地区不单独考试，但对英语整体水平的提升有显著促进作用。高二阶段需要系统训练听力理解策略，同时通过口语练习巩固语音语调和即时表达能力。</p>\n<p>本节核心内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高考听力的题型与应试策略</strong></li>\n<li><strong>听力理解的三个层次</strong>：辨音、理解、推断</li>\n<li><strong>常见听力场景与高频词汇</strong></li>\n<li><strong>语音语调的核心要素</strong>：连读、弱读、重音、语调</li>\n<li><strong>口语表达的实用框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-高考听力题型分析\">一、高考听力题型分析</h3><p>高考听力通常分为两大部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>题目特点</th>\n<th>播放次数</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短对话</td>\n<td>每段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个来回，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 道题</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长对话/独白</td>\n<td>篇幅较长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 道题</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>听前准备策略</strong>：</p>\n<p>在播放录音前的空隙时间（通常有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 秒），快速浏览题目和选项。这一步至关重要，因为它能让你带着目标去听，而不是被动接收信息。</p>\n<p><strong>浏览选项时注意</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三个选项的<strong>差异点</strong>在哪里——差异点往往就是考点</li>\n<li>选项中的数字、时间、地点等具体信息要特别留意</li>\n<li>如果三个选项都是地点，那么问题一定是问&quot;在哪里&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-听力理解的三个层次\">二、听力理解的三个层次</h3><p><strong>第一层：辨音（Sound Recognition）</strong></p>\n<p>准确辨别英语中的相似音是听力的基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>易混音</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>/iː/ vs /ɪ/</td>\n<td>sheep vs ship, seat vs sit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/e/ vs /æ/</td>\n<td>bed vs bad, pen vs pan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/l/ vs /r/</td>\n<td>light vs right, long vs wrong</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/θ/ vs /s/</td>\n<td>think vs sink, path vs pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/n/ vs /ŋ/</td>\n<td>sin vs sing, thin vs thing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>数字听辨</strong>是常见考点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发音相似的数字</th>\n<th>区别方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>thirteen vs thirty</td>\n<td>-teen 重音在后，-ty 重音在前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fifteen vs fifty</td>\n<td>fifteen: /fɪfˈtiːn/, fifty: /ˈfɪfti/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>forty vs fourteen</td>\n<td>forty 没有 /r/ 音后的 /tiːn/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第二层：理解（Comprehension）</strong></p>\n<p>理解说话者的核心信息——谁、什么、在哪里、什么时候、为什么、怎么样。</p>\n<p><strong>注意转折词后的信息</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>A: Shall we go to the cinema tonight?</em>\n<em>B: I&#39;d love to, <strong>but</strong> I have to prepare for tomorrow&#39;s exam.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>问题如果问 B 今晚要做什么，答案是&quot;准备考试&quot;而不是&quot;去电影院&quot;。<em>but</em> 后面的内容才是真正的答案。</p>\n<p>类似的信号词：<em>however, actually, in fact, to be honest, the thing is</em></p>\n<p><strong>第三层：推断（Inference）</strong></p>\n<p>根据语境和语气推断言外之意。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>A: Could you give me a ride to the airport?</em>\n<em>B: Well, my car is in the repair shop.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>B 没有直接说&quot;不行&quot;，但通过&quot;车在修理厂&quot;间接表达了无法提供帮助。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-常见听力场景与高频表达\">三、常见听力场景与高频表达</h3><p>高考听力的对话场景相对固定，熟悉这些场景的高频词汇可以大幅降低理解难度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>高频词汇与表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>购物</td>\n<td>discount, on sale, receipt, try on, size, cash or card</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>餐厅</td>\n<td>reserve a table, menu, appetizer, main course, check/bill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医院</td>\n<td>appointment, symptom, prescription, take medicine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机场/车站</td>\n<td>departure, boarding pass, gate, delay, platform, one-way/round trip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学校</td>\n<td>assignment, deadline, semester, grade, register, drop a course</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天气</td>\n<td>forecast, clear up, shower, temperature, breeze</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酒店</td>\n<td>check in/out, single/double room, vacancy, wake-up call</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>电话场景的特殊表达</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Could I speak to...?</em> / <em>Is... available?</em></li>\n<li><em>I&#39;m afraid he&#39;s not in at the moment.</em></li>\n<li><em>Could you take a message?</em></li>\n<li><em>I&#39;ll have him call you back.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-语音语调的核心要素\">四、语音语调的核心要素</h3><p><strong>连读（Linking）</strong>：当前一个单词以辅音结尾、后一个单词以元音开头时，两个词连在一起读。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连读示例</th>\n<th>读法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pick it up</td>\n<td>/pɪ-kɪ-tʌp/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>an apple</td>\n<td>/ə-næpl/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>not at all</td>\n<td>/nɒ-tə-tɔːl/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>弱读（Weak Forms）</strong>：功能词（冠词、介词、连词、助动词）在句中通常弱读。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单词</th>\n<th>强读</th>\n<th>弱读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>and</td>\n<td>/ænd/</td>\n<td>/ən/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>to</td>\n<td>/tuː/</td>\n<td>/tə/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>can</td>\n<td>/kæn/</td>\n<td>/kən/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>for</td>\n<td>/fɔːr/</td>\n<td>/fər/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>句子重音（Sentence Stress）</strong>：实义词（名词、动词、形容词、副词）重读，功能词弱读。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em><strong>JOHN</strong> bought a <strong>NEW</strong> <strong>CAR</strong> <strong>YESTERDAY</strong>.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>重读的词携带了句子的核心信息。</p>\n<p><strong>语调（Intonation）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语调</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>升调 ↗</td>\n<td>一般疑问句、不确定、礼貌</td>\n<td><em>Would you like some tea?</em> ↗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降调 ↘</td>\n<td>陈述句、命令句、感叹句</td>\n<td><em>That&#39;s a great idea.</em> ↘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先升后降 ↗↘</td>\n<td>选择疑问句</td>\n<td><em>Tea ↗ or coffee ↘?</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-口语表达实用框架\">五、口语表达实用框架</h3><p><strong>表达观点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>In my opinion, ...</em> / <em>From my point of view, ...</em></li>\n<li><em>I strongly believe that...</em> / <em>As far as I&#39;m concerned, ...</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>表示同意/不同意</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同意：<em>I couldn&#39;t agree more.</em> / <em>That&#39;s exactly what I think.</em></li>\n<li>部分同意：<em>I see your point, but...</em> / <em>That may be true, however...</em></li>\n<li>不同意：<em>I&#39;m afraid I don&#39;t agree.</em> / <em>I see things differently.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>描述与叙述</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间顺序：<em>First... Then... After that... Finally...</em></li>\n<li>描述地点：<em>It&#39;s located in... / It&#39;s a... place with...</em></li>\n<li>描述人物：<em>He/She is the kind of person who...</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>讨论话题的PREP框架</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P</strong>oint（观点）：陈述你的立场</li>\n<li><strong>R</strong>eason（理由）：解释为什么</li>\n<li><strong>E</strong>xample（举例）：用具体例子支撑</li>\n<li><strong>P</strong>oint（重申）：重新强调观点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>听一段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的英语新闻（如 BBC Learning English 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> Minute English），记录下你听到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个关键信息点。</li>\n<li>练习数字听辨：请朋友或使用 APP 随机报出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 等数字，听写并核对。</li>\n<li>朗读以下句子，注意连读和弱读：<ul>\n<li><em>I&#39;d like a cup of tea, please.</em></li>\n<li><em>Could you pick it up for me?</em></li>\n<li><em>We went to an interesting exhibition.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>用 PREP 框架就以下话题进行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的口语练习：&quot;你认为高中生应该被允许使用手机吗？&quot;</li>\n<li>听一段高考听力真题，统计你因为以下原因丢分的题数：生词、语速快、走神、陷阱题。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>听力能力的提升遵循&quot;可理解输入&quot;（Comprehensible Input）理论——你需要听略高于当前水平的材料（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），既有挑战又不至于完全听不懂。</p>\n<p>推荐的听力训练资源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BBC Learning English</strong>：分级明确，语速适中，适合高中生</li>\n<li><strong>VOA Learning English</strong>：慢速英语，适合打基础</li>\n<li><strong>TED-Ed</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的教育视频，有字幕可以辅助理解</li>\n<li><strong>英文播客</strong>：如 <em>6 Minute English</em>、<em>All Ears English</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>口语训练的核心是&quot;开口说&quot;。&quot;影子跟读法&quot;（Shadowing）是一种高效的口语训练方式：播放一段英文音频，几乎同步地跟读，模仿说话者的语音、语调和节奏。每天坚持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟影子跟读，一个月后语音语调会有明显改善。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>听前浏览题目和选项是高考听力的关键准备步骤</li>\n<li>注意转折词（but, however, actually）后面的信息——那往往才是答案</li>\n<li>连读、弱读和句子重音是听懂自然语速英语的三大障碍</li>\n<li>熟悉常见场景的高频词汇可以降低理解难度</li>\n<li>口语表达用 PREP 框架组织，做到有观点、有理由、有例证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二英语 — 听说训练","id":"高二英语-听说训练"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、高考听力题型分析","id":"一-高考听力题型分析"},{"level":3,"text":"二、听力理解的三个层次","id":"二-听力理解的三个层次"},{"level":3,"text":"三、常见听力场景与高频表达","id":"三-常见听力场景与高频表达"},{"level":3,"text":"四、语音语调的核心要素","id":"四-语音语调的核心要素"},{"level":3,"text":"五、口语表达实用框架","id":"五-口语表达实用框架"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二英语 — 写作技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/english/exam-preparation/writing-skills"},"next":null}